	<content contentuid="hacdf1a2dgc3b3g400egbbf9g8530289f54f0" version="1">麻痺毒素</content>
	<content contentuid="h6570de61gaa50g487egacf3g6a6b631de163" version="1">受到你&lt;b&gt;主要&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;傷害的敵人必須通過一次&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痹&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;回合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;取決於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
